  "title": "Mediterranean Crusted Chicken",
  "description": "A deliciously rich chicken entree that is best served with mild side dishes such as sauteed vegetables and French bread. This chicken has a great fresh basil flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Suzanne"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-11-03T11:27:27-05:00",
